AR50 test data in this directory
================================

ar50_sample.gml is cut from NIBIO's AR50 land-resource map at 1:50 000 for
Innlandet (34_25832_ar50_gml.gml, downloaded 2026-10-19): the file's first
720 bytes, an XML comment carrying the credit below, six whole
gml:featureMember elements copied byte for byte (the file's features 1 to 5
and 12,843), and the closing root tag. Nothing inside a feature is changed.

tests/python/test_invalid_polygons.py carries one polygon of the same map,
inline: feature 191902's 12 vertices in EPSG:25832, copied unchanged from
the same map for Innlandet (downloaded 2026-10-19).

